  message: "Priority-inversion flag: this root_cause_family META is P2, but it holds the P0 member WI-kufib (262 synthesized stand-in nodes emit null Symbol.language, failing whole-doc schema validation). A 'tracker ready' reader sees the member's P0 urgency, not the family's P2. Documenting only; no priority change made. Consider bumping the family to P0 to match its highest-severity member if/when this cluster is actioned."  # c2dd
