  message: "synthetic:F2 (5a, PR #226, merged dev c058b59a55): Class-B synth stand-ins no longer leave stable_id/display_label/fingerprint at empty defaults — populate_synthetic_class_b_identity fills them via an injective (protocol_origin, kind, path, name, occurrence) key. Member status: META-huvuh -> satisfied (display_label producer+validator). WI-fozoh/WI-kapul-ganan/WI-sijut's external_symbol facets + the 5b kind-slot migration remain (deferred to v6/ADR-0037); WI-hulup is a path gap not addressed by 5a. Staying violated pending the external_symbol/5b work."  # 7937
