      statement: "Synthesized external_symbol / stand-in nodes must carry stable_id, path, origin, origin_run_id, fingerprint, and a correct id kind-slot -- not None/''/'<external>' defaults. SCOPE (2026-07-21 audit): 6 of 7 members are done (WI-fozoh stable_id / WI-sijut origin / WI-mosil origin_run_id / WI-lisog fingerprint / WI-pubiv kind-slot / WI-kufib language), so those fields are no longer at defaults. The ONLY facet still reproducing is `path` (WI-kapul path=='<external>' + WI-hulup npm_package path==''). NOTE: `canonical_name` was removed by ADR-0032 and `language=None` on stand-ins is by-design per ADR-0031 -- both dropped from the original must-carry list."  # d8ff
